RAY_MOD_CARD_UNTAPPED_TREASURE.descripti:
Can only be played if your [gold]Depth[/gold] is greater than {RequiredDepth:diff()}.
Deal {Damage:diff()} damage, lose {DepthLossPerPlay:diff()} [gold]Depth[/gold] and add a copy to your draw pile; plays once more for each [gold]Depth[/gold] card you have in combat, until your [gold]Depth[/gold] is too low.{InCombat:
({ExtraPlays:diff()} extra plays)|}

